摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: Bilibili video search, metadata, and subtitle transcripts (bilibili_search / bilibili_video / bilibili_subtitles) · DeepSeek Harness 插件:B 站视频检索、元数据与字幕文稿,匿名可用,可选 SESSDATA 解锁登录字幕","id":"gh:1335287540","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-bilibili","slug":"moxingovo/dsh-bilibili","topics":["agent-tool","bilibili","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","subtitles","video"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin: Bilibili video search, metadata, and subtitle transcripts (bilibili_search "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"/ bilibili_video / bilibili_subtitles) · DeepSeek Harness 插件:B 站视频检索、元数据与字幕文稿,匿名可用,可选 SESSDATA 解锁登录字"},{"id":"p1s3","text":" bilibili_video / bilibili_subtitles) · DeepSeek Harness 插件:B 站视频检索、元数据与字幕文稿,匿名可用,可选 SESSDATA 解锁登录字幕"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-bilibili"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | **English** · Changelog · Releases"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A **Bilibili retrieval plugin** for DeepSeek Harness.\nAfter install the agent gains five tools:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- `bilibili_search` — find videos by keyword: title, uploader, play count, duration, publish date.\n-"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" `bilibili_video` — full metadata for one video: counts, partition, multi-part pages, description.\n-"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" `bilibili_subtitles` — the subtitle transcript of one video, merged into plain text.\n- `bilibili_pl"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ayurl` — the direct mp4 play URL (and granted quality/size) for downloads or frame extraction.\n- `bi"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"libili_frames` — real video frames (preview sprite grid, cover fallback, or ffmpeg extraction) as im"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"age blocks, so image-capable models can watch the actual footage instead of relying on subtitles alo"},{"id":"p5s7","text":" blocks, so image-capable models can watch the actual footage instead of relying on subtitles alone."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Anonymous by default: search bootstraps an anonymous cookie automatically and metadata always works."},{"id":"p6s2","text":"\nSet a SESSDATA cookie to unlock login-gated subtitle tracks (where most AI subtitles live), higher-"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"quality\nplay URLs, and the frames preview path. Effectively read-only: the plugin reads metadata, su"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"btitles and\nframe images only — it never stores or re-uploads videos."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> Unofficial community plugin — not affiliated with DeepSeek or Bilibili.\n>\n> **Harness compatibilit"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"y**: **0.2.3** is verified on **DeepSeek Harness 0.1.7-rc.2** and\n> **0.1.6-alpha.2** (Typert API Ga"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"teway) from one build. The 0.1.0–0.1.5 line works as well —\n> nothing in the plugin uses the 0.1.6+ "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"codec API. Version map in Compatibility."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`. New conversations gain `bilibili_search`, `bilibili_video`, `bilibili_subtitles`,"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"\n`bilibili_playurl` and `bilibili_frames`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Mount it in an agent preset instead when only that preset should see the tools:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Optional SESSDATA"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Log into bilibili.com, open DevTools → Application → Cookies → the `bilibili.com` entry, and copy th"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"e\n**bare** `SESSDATA` value — not the whole cookie header. Put it in the environment or in your\n`$DS"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"H_HOME/.env` (the launcher injects every `KEY=VALUE` line of that file into the server process):"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Without it only publicly visible subtitle tracks are returned; videos whose tracks require login fai"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"l\nwith the structured code `BILIBILI_LOGIN_REQUIRED`. A bare token is fine — the plugin prefixes\n`SE"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"tured code `BILIBILI_LOGIN_REQUIRED`. A bare token is fine — the plugin prefixes\n`SESSDATA=` itself."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| Key | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `baseUrl` | `https://api.bilibili.com` | API host. |\n| `cookie` | — | Literal SESSDATA token (secr"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"et; prefer `cookieEnv`). |\n| `cookieEnv` | `BILIBILI_SESSDATA` | Environment variable naming the opt"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ional SESSDATA token. |\n| `userAgent` | Chrome 126 desktop UA | User-Agent header. |\n| `requestTimeo"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"utMs` | `30000` | Per-request timeout in ms. |\n| `subtitleLanguage` | `zh-CN` | Preferred subtitle l"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"anguage tag; exact match wins, else the first track. |\n| `searchMaxPageSize` | `20` | Page-size ceil"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"ing for `bilibili_search`. |\n| `subtitleMaxChars` | `80000` | Transcript character cap for `bilibili"},{"id":"p19s7","text":"_subtitles`, value-level with a `truncated` flag. |\n| `timeoutMs` | `30000` | Cooperative tool-call "},{"id":"p19s8","text":"e-level with a `truncated` flag. |\n| `timeoutMs` | `30000` | Cooperative tool-call timeout budget. |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Override any field in `profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` — later layers win per row:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"This package is self-contained: it registers the tools and carries its own Bilibili REST provider.\nI"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"t does **not** publish a `ctx.bilibili` service, so no other plugin can consume it by service key\n(a"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"n earlier in-tree line did — see Compatibility)."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Tools and error codes"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Tools fail with structured errors carrying these codes:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Code | Meaning |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| `BILIBILI_RISK_CONTROL` | `-412` risk control. Retry later; an implicit search already retried onc"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"e with `pubdate`. |\n| `BILIBILI_FORBIDDEN` | `-403` refused. |\n| `BILIBILI_NOT_FOUND` | `-404` video"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" missing or deleted. |\n| `BILIBILI_LOGIN_REQUIRED` | `-101` needs the login cookie (subtitles, highe"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"r-quality play URLs). |\n| `BILIBILI_SUBTITLES_UNAVAILABLE` | No accessible track, or an empty subtit"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"le body. |\n| `BILIBILI_PLAYURL_UNAVAILABLE` | No usable mp4 direct URL for this video. |\n| `BILIBILI"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"_REDIRECT_REFUSED` | A redirect was refused — the credential-safety guard. |\n| `BILIBILI_BAD_RESPONS"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"E` | Non-JSON body, or an envelope without a `code` field. |\n| `BILIBILI_API_ERROR` | Envelope `code"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"` non-zero and not covered by a specific mapping above. |\n| `BILIBILI_REQUEST_FAILED` | Network fail"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"ure, including timeouts. |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- The cookie is read from the environment (or an explicit literal config value) only; it never enter"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"s\nlogs or tool output.\n- Every request refuses redirects, so the cookie can never be forwarded to an"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"other origin.\n- The cookie is sent only to the configured API host (`api.bilibili.com` by default); "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"subtitle CDN\ndownloads carry no cookie.\n- No video or audio download (`bilibili_frames`' `extract` m"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"ode downloads the mp4 to a temp directory\nto run ffmpeg, then deletes it)."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Plugin | DeepSeek Harness | Notes |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| 0.2.3 | **0.1.7-rc.2**, 0.1.6-alpha.2 | 0.1.7 removed the shared `plugin` message-source kind; `bi"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"libili_frames` declares its own `bilibili-frames` kind. One build serves both. |\n| 0.2.2 | 0.1.6-alp"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ha.2 | Verified, no code change (the plugin does not use the typert codec API). |\n| 0.2.0–0.2.1 | 0."},{"id":"p31s4","text":"1.0 – 0.1.6 | `bilibili_playurl` and `bilibili_frames` landed here. |\n| 0.1.x | 0.1.0 line | `bilibi"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"li_search` / `bilibili_video` / `bilibili_subtitles` only. |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Live-verified on 0.1.7-rc.2: `bilibili_search`, `bilibili_video`, `bilibili_playurl`.\n`bilibili_subt"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"itles` returns the documented `BILIBILI_SUBTITLES_UNAVAILABLE` for videos without a\ntrack. Typecheck"},{"id":"p32s3","text":", build and all 20 tests pass against `@deepseek-ai/*@0.1.7-rc.2`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
